 "remarks": "Welcome to 15 Priscilla Road! Nestled in a peaceful West Norwalk neighborhood, this sun-filled, move-in-ready home was fully renovated in 2021 and offers a bright, open-concept design perfect for everyday living and entertaining. Beautiful hardwood floors, high ceilings, and seamless flow between the living, dining, and kitchen areas create an inviting atmosphere. The modern kitchen features stainless steel appliances and quartzite countertops, while the deck and newly added patio (2026) overlook a spacious, level, fully fenced backyard. The upper level features a primary suite with walk-in closet and ensuite bath, two additional bedrooms, and a full hall bath. Downstairs, enjoy a generous family/playroom, fourth bedroom or office, and full bath, with sliders opening to the backyard. Additional highlights include dual-zone heating/cooling, a 2024 washer/dryer, wine chiller/fridge, and spacious two-car garage equipped with an EV charger. Conveniently located near schools, restaurants, shopping, and local amenities, this turnkey home is ready to enjoy!",
